	(text "U18 keeps encoder phase and echo pulse polarity.\nR72-R75: pull-ups for 5 V open-collector / push-pull encoders.\nJ5: external ultrasonic module, 5 V / TRIG / ECHO / GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220.472 345.1 0)
		(effects
